<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/darwin1859-ch13-23> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasAssessment> <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch13-23--grok>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch13-23--grok--analysis-feasibility>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch13-23--grok--data-adequacy>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch13-23--grok--data-existence>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch13-23--grok--discriminating-power>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch13-23--grok--operationalizability>
